liblol (0.1.11-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the libLoL (LoongArch on LoongArch)
    user-space runtime.  The GNU C Library 2.43 sources (the upstream
    tarball of this package) are built with the libLoL old-world ABI
    compatibility patch series:
    - debian/patches/liblol: old-world ABI symbol compatibility,
      signal/pthread compatibility, syscall fallbacks and trusted
      directory support.
    - The patched runtimes are installed below
      /usr/lib/loongarch64-debian-linux-gnuow/preload/ as documented at
      <https://liblol.aosc.io/docs/usage/> for Debian.
    - debian/rules and debian/control are rewritten for this package;
      all other glibc packaging content has been dropped.

 -- Mingcong Bai <jeffbai@aosc.io>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:10:00 +0800
